🖥️ TFT Display (ILI9341) — Wiki Standard

    SCK (CLK): GPIO 36
    MOSI (DIN): GPIO 35
    MISO (DO): GPIO 37
    CS: GPIO 17
    DC (RS): GPIO 16
    RESET: EN / RESET
    Backlight (BL): GPIO 7
👆 Touch Screen (XPT2046)

    SCK (T_CLK): GPIO 36
    MOSI (T_DIN): GPIO 35
    MISO (T_DO): GPIO 37
    CS (T_CS): GPIO 18
    IRQ (T_IRQ): Disabled (255)

)

💾 SD Card (SPI)

    SCK (SCLK): GPIO 12
    MOSI: GPIO 11
    MISO: GPIO 13
    CS: GPIO 10 (Note: SD_CS_PIN 5 is also defined in code)
    CD (Card Detect): GPIO 38

📡 NRF24 Modules (3x — Shared SPI Bus)

    SCK: GPIO 12
    MOSI: GPIO 11
    MISO: GPIO 13
    NRF24 #1: CE = GPIO 15 | CSN = GPIO 4
    NRF24 #2: CE = GPIO 47 | CSN = GPIO 48
    NRF24 #3 (Scanner/ESB): CE = GPIO 14 | CSN = GPIO 21

📻 CC1101 (Sub-GHz — Shared SPI Bus)

    SCK: GPIO 12
    MOSI: GPIO 11
    MISO: GPIO 13
    CSN (CS): GPIO 5
    GDO0 (TX): GPIO 6
    GDO2 (RX): GPIO 3

💳 PN532 RFID / NFC (Shared SPI Bus)

    SCK: GPIO 12
    MOSI: GPIO 11
    MISO: GPIO 13
    SS (CS): GPIO 8 (Modified from Wiki's GPIO 4)

🔦 Infrared (IR Remote)

    IR RX: GPIO 21 (Shares pin with NRF24 #3 CSN)
    IR TX: GPIO 14 (Shares pin with NRF24 #3 CE)

🎮 Navigation Buttons (Direct GPIO)

    UP: GPIO 39
    DOWN: GPIO 40
    LEFT: GPIO 41
    RIGHT: GPIO 42
    SELECT: GPIO 45

🔌 External UART & System

    UART RX: GPIO 6 (Shares pin with CC1101 GDO0/TX)
    UART TX: GPIO 3 (Shares pin with CC1101 GDO2/RX)
    Buzzer: Disabled (-1)
    Battery ADC: Disabled (-1)
